# Structural TypeAssert: type alias defined in dict entry is available across documents
# [MyType: [type Int]] registers MyType as an alias for Int in the type environment.
# Document 2: [@MyType 42] uses the alias; type checker resolves it to Type::Int.
#
# This test exercises CoreExpr::TypeAssert via the TypeAnnotationTable (pre-resolved at
# type-check time), NOT the TypeAssertPending runtime handler in eval.rs. The pipeline
# boundary (---) propagates the TypeAnnotationTable so the resolved type is available
# without any runtime annotation re-resolution.
[MyType: [type Int]]
---
[@MyType 42]
=== out
Int(42)
